  "html": "<article data-article-id=\"a3b8ac83-47f6-4fb5-b9df-ad8696077a05\">\n  <p>I had a drug problem when I was a young person and a teenager.</p>\n  <p>I was drug to church on Sunday morning. I was drug to church on Sunday night. I was drug to church on Wednesday night. I was drug to Sunday School every week. I was drug to Vacation Bible School.</p>\n  <p>I was drug to the family altar to read the Bible and pray. I was also drug to the woodshed when I disobeyed my parents.</p>\n  <p>Those drugs are still in my veins. And they affect my behavior in everything I do and say and think. They are stronger than cocaine, crack, or heroine.</p>\n  <p>If our children would have this drug problem, the world would certainly be a better place.</p>\n</article>\n",
